              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icompa ugasatura ijuru ukamanuka, imisozi igahindira agashitsi imbere yawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bikaba nk’uk’ umuriro ufata inyabara, kandi nk’uk’ umuriro ubiza amazi: kugira ngw izina ryawe rimenyekane mu bansi bawe, amahanga ahindire agashitsi imbere yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 14:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wakora ibiteye ubgoba tutīteze, waramanutse, imisozi ihindira agashitsi imbere yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.31.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 31:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ uhereye kera hose ata ho abantu bīgeze kwumva, canke ngo bibagwe mu matwi, canke ngo baboneshe amaso iyindi mana igira ico imarira abayīteze atari wewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usanganira ūnezererwa gukora ivy’ ukugororoka, n’abagendera mu nzira zawe bakwibuka; ariko wararatse, kuko twakoze ivyaha, mbere tubimazemw’ igihe kirekire; mbega, none twoba tugikizwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.90.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 90:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.90.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko twese twahindutse nk’ibihumane, kand’ ukugororoka kwacu kwose kumeze nk’impuzu yanduye; twese dukabiranye nk’ikibabi, kand’ ibigabitanyo vyacu bidukubeba nk’ umuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.7.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 7:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nta n’umwe yambaza izina ryawe, nta wuruha yinanata ngo yimatanye nawe; kuko waduhishije mu nyonga hawe, ukaduhebera mu bigabitanyo vyacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:8"
